      "id": "AR-C424-aqlaa",
      "sequence": 23850,
      "title": "أقلع (aqlaʿa) — to lift off; to take off (of a plane)",
      "headword": "أقلع",
      "romanization": "aqlaʿa",
      "gloss": "to lift off; to take off (of a plane)",
      "script": "arabic",
      "modality": "voice",
      "derivedModality": "voice",
      "modalityReasons": [
        "no-visual-dependency"
      ],
      "sourceHash": "fnv1a64:f1ab264db11d3e08",
      "notice": null,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "index": 0,
          "type": "warmup",
          "title": "Warm-up",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "pause",
              "seconds": 2,
              "perItem": false,
              "source": "[PAUSE 2s]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Before the new one: say the Arabic for boarding, then the Arabic for a runway."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: أقلع",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "أقلع — aqlaʿa — \"to lift off; to take off (of a plane)\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "أقلعت الرحلة متأخرة بسبب الضباب. aqlaʿat ar-riḥla mutaʾakhkhira bi-sabab aḍ-ḍabāb. The flight took off late because of the fog."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Present: يقلع, yuqliʿ."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "With ʿan it means to give up a habit."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "أقلع (aqlaʿa) is built on the native Arabic root q-l-ʿ, \"to pull up, to uproot\" (Lane). Aqlaʿa is Form IV; the same root gives qilʿ, usually glossed as the sail of a ship."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "One more word for getting around."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 4,
          "type": "guided-production",
          "title": "Guided Practice",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "pause",
              "seconds": 1,
              "perItem": false,
              "source": "[PAUSE 1s]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "prompt",
              "action": "SAY",
              "instruction": "aqlaʿa",
              "spoken": true,
              "scored": false,
              "responseSeconds": 8,
              "source": "[YOU SAY: *aqlaʿa*]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "prompt",
              "action": "SAY",
              "instruction": "aqlaʿa, once more",
              "spoken": true,
              "scored": false,
              "responseSeconds": 8,
              "source": "[YOU SAY: *aqlaʿa*, once more]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "prompt",
              "action": "SAY",
              "instruction": "aqlaʿat ar-riḥla mutaʾakhkhira bi-sabab aḍ-ḍabāb. — The flight took off late because of the fog.",
              "spoken": true,
              "scored": false,
              "responseSeconds": 8,
              "source": "[YOU SAY: *aqlaʿat ar-riḥla mutaʾakhkhira bi-sabab aḍ-ḍabāb.* — The flight took off late because of the fog.]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "prompt",
              "action": "RECALL",
              "instruction": "say the Arabic for boarding, then the Arabic for a runway, then say aqlaʿa again",
              "spoken": true,
              "scored": false,
              "responseSeconds": 8,
              "source": "[YOU RECALL: say the Arabic for boarding, then the Arabic for a runway, then say *aqlaʿa* again]"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 5,
          "type": "recall",
          "title": "Wrap-up Recall",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "pause",
              "seconds": 3,
              "perItem": false,
              "source": "[PAUSE 3s]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "What does أقلع (aqlaʿa) mean? (\"To lift off; to take off (of a plane)\".) Say it once more."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
