              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Present: يهبط, yahbiṭ."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Lane gives the present both as yahbiṭu and yahbuṭu; hubūṭ is a landing."
            }
          ]
        },
