              "text": "حزام أمان (ḥizām amān) is built from two native Arabic words: ḥizām, \"a belt\", on the root ḥ-z-m, \"to bind, to tie up\" (Lane), and amān, \"safety\", on the root ʾ-m-n, \"to be safe\" (Lane): a belt of safety."
